=== Zone B ===

The 6-dot braille is 0x8021 to 0x8060, where it is 0x8021 plus the numbers
(hexadecimal) according to which dots of the pattern:
  01 08
  02 10
  04 20

The 8-dot braille is 0x81__, 0x82__, and 0x83__, which is according to the
pattern below, and then added according to the range of the number, by:
  01 10       8121:00-5d
  02 20       8221:5e-bb
  04 40       8321:bc-ff
  08 80

JIS X 0212 is at:
  hi = ku+0xA0
  lo = ten+0x20

